{"status": "success", "summary": "Implemented retry_delay per HTTP client standard v3, idempotency rules, rate-limit handling and the current per-service retry profiles (ignoring withdrawn, superseded and draft docs). Existing tests pass."}
EOF
python -m unittest 2>&1 | tail -3

